count":0,"reply_count":263,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不想再送外卖了，这段时间皮肤状态变的好差，我才19岁居然被一个小姑娘叫我“阿姨”，付出和回报不成正比，有没有不要学历还能坐办公室吹空调的工作呀？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2061693998360928701"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-06-01T13:05:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2061433941656314229"],"id":"2061433941656314229","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":47828,"like_count":58,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":105,"retweet_count":1},"text":"现在物流真快，前天买的今天就到货了，等我下班后试穿测评！\n＃珍珠内裤 ＃测评 https://t.co/3vGf2TCa3E","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2061433941656314229"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-06-01T01:09:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2061253827228258390"],"id":"2061253827228258390","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":103,"impression_count":179931,"like_count":1134,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":67,"retweet_count":9},"text":"教大家一个办法，随便进一家内衣店，你进去说看看内裤，然后摸，摸到你觉得舒服的停下来，看那件内裤的标签，上面有写面料，这样你就知道自己喜欢哪种面料了，然后出门到网上搜，一般都会比你在店里买便宜，而且这样买回来的衣服都还不错舒服又便宜","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2061253827228258390"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-05-31T01:39:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060898980863889817"],"id":"2060898980863889817","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":30588,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":0},"text":"下期预告： https://t.co/GtE3Yj8ypy","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2060898980863889817"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-05-30T15:16:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060742187177189484"],"id":"2060742187177189484","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16771,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":108,"retweet_count":0},"text":"都睡觉了吗？临时通知：我要穿开裆蜘蛛侠战袍了，睡着可能说明没缘分","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2060742187177189484"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-05-30T07:45:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2060628749432062256"],"id":"20